        <title-group>
          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[존 파울즈의 『프랑스 중위의 여자』 에 나타난 시대사상]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[Victorian Ideas in The French Lieutenant’s Woman by John Fowles]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[Victorian Ideas in The French Lieutenant’s Woman by John Fowles]]></article-title>
        </title-group>
        <author-group>
